======================================================================
  5. ANALYTICAL RELATIONSHIPS
======================================================================

  Total self-loops: 1760
  Predicted (2^m * m * f(n)): 3200
  Match: False
  Average self-loops per tournament: 1.7188
  = m * f(n) = 3.1250

  |Aut|=1 classes: 7 classes
    Degree range: [6, 7]
    Average degree: 6.43
    Sum of degrees: 45

  |Aut|>1 classes: 5 classes
    Sum of degrees: 15

  Total degree: 60
  Edges: 30

  Degree from |Aut|=1: 45/60 = 0.750
  At large n, almost all classes have |Aut|=1.
  So: edges ~ (1/2) * A000568(n) * (m - avg_self_loops)
  where avg_self_loops ~ m * f(n) = m * (1/2)_{n-2}/(n-2)!
  giving: edges ~ (1/2) * A000568(n) * m * (1 - f(n))
  = (1/2) * A000568(n) * C(n,2) * (1 - (1/2)_{n-2}/(n-2)!)
  n=3: predicted=2, actual=1, ratio=0.667
  n=4: predicted=8, actual=5, ratio=0.667
  n=5: predicted=41, actual=30, ratio=0.727
  n=6: predicted=305, actual=290, ratio=0.950
